      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this will work. powerindebug command does not probe the state of power signal gpios. It simply prints out the state in in_signals. And the state of in_signals is updated _only_ by power_update_signals which is called by power_signal_interrupt. But, since GPIO_PCH_SLP_S0_L is no longer configured as an interrupt, in_signals will not be updated on entry/exit into/from S0ix.",
